    <img src="../../images/oisp/education-hero.jpg" alt="three doorways">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell large-7 small-12">
                <h1>Education and Development Opportunities</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="cell large-5 small-12">
                <img src="../../images/oisp/education-hero.jpg" alt="three doorways">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% include "@components/navigation-prototypes/navbar-oisp.twig" %}

<main>
<section>
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <main class="cell small-12 large-8">
                <h2>Education &amp; Development Opportunities</h2>
                <p>OISP offers education and development programs designed to help faculty and research teams explore the commercial potential of their innovations. From early-stage market discovery to mentorship and venture development, these programs support innovators at every stage of the journey.</p>
                <p>Programs are available to faculty, researchers, and select graduate students.</p>
            </main>
            <aside class="cell small-12 large-4">
            <div class="margin-bottom">
<ul class="vertical menu accordion-menu" data-accordion-menu id="subnav">
  <li>
    <a href="#">Education and Development Opportunities</a>
  </li>
  <li><a href="#">Founders Elect</a></li>
  <li>
    <a href="#">Commercialization Workshop Series</a>
  </li>
  <li><a href="#">Entrepreneur In-Residence Program</a></li>
  <li><a href="#">IdeaLaunch – Southwest I-Corps</a></li>
  <li><a href="#">Internship Opportunities</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bleed beige">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x align-center">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6">
                <div class="callout nested text-center">
                    <h2 class="h3">Founders Elect</h2>
                    <p>UT San Antonio’s flagship faculty startup formation program, offering standardized terms and two flexible pathways to take your innovation from invention disclosure to operating company.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Learn More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h2 class="h3">Commercialization Workshops</h2>
                    <p>Hands-on workshops that introduce faculty to market-first thinking, customer discovery, commercialization pathways, including licensing and startup options.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Learn More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h2 class="h3">Entrepreneur-in-Resident (EIR) Program</h2>
                    <p>One-on-one guidance from experienced entrepreneurs to help faculty assess commercial strategy, refine value propositions, and navigate next steps toward impact.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Learn More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h2 class="h3">NSF I-Corps Southwest IdeaLaunch</h2>
                    <p>A nationally recognized program that provides structured customer discovery training and funding, helping faculty teams validate real-world needs and de-risk their path to commercialization.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Learn More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-6 flex-container">
                <div class="callout nested text-center flex-child-auto">
                    <h2 class="h3">Business Development Internship Program</h2>
                    <p>Hands-on experiential learning where graduate-level interns work with OISP’s Market Opportunity &amp; Development team to evaluate technologies, conduct market analyses, and support early-stage business planning.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="button">Learn More</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bleed">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <h2>How These Programs Fit Together</h2>
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-8">
                <p>These programs are designed to work together — not in isolation. Faculty and research teams may enter at different points depending on the maturity of their innovation and progress through multiple programs as their commercialization efforts evolve.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-4">
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Early exploration:</strong> Commercialization Workshops</li>
                    <li><strong>Market validation:</strong> NSF I-Corps</li>
                    <li><strong>Strategic guidance:</strong> Entrepreneur-in-Resident (EIR) Program</li>
                    <li><strong>Company Formation:</strong> Founders Elect</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="bleed light-grey">
    <div class="grid-container">
        <h2>Not Sure Where to Begin?</h2>
        <div class="grid-x grid-margin-x">
            <div class="cell small-12 large-8">
                <p>OISP staff can help identify the most appropriate starting point based on your innovation, goals, and timeline.</p>
            <p><a href="#" class="button">Submit an Innovation Disclosure</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="cell small-12 large-4">
            <a class="callout color blue flex-child-auto">
                <span class="fa-stack fa-2x">
                    <i class="fas fa-circle fa-stack-2x"></i>
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope fa-stack-1x fa-inverse"></i>
                </span>
                <h3>Contact OISP</h3>
            </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
</main>

